1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =='''Bengt Elofsson''' (vingad pil)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Bengt Eales (winged arrow) was the Son of Birger Jarl 's brother Elof Magnusson and is the first to have a weapon with an arrow with wings.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''Katarina,''' her last name is unknown 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Katarina last name is Unknown ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Helga Bengtsson,''' Vinget Pil (winged arrow), married Magnus Knutsson (Son of Knut Jonsson)
2 CONT * '''Margareta Bengtsson''' (winged arrow) (~ 1295-) married Erik Turesson , ~ før 1315
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Bengtsson''' (winged arrow)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Bengt Eales (winged arrow) Wikipedia==
2 CONT
2 CONT He is mentioned in Swedish Diplomatariums Huvudkartotek as Omnibus Christi Fidelibus presents Inspecturis, Benedict Eleph son Salutem in Domino Sempiternam propane hominumLabilem memoriam, when in a proclamation in February in 129
2 CONC 3 Announces that forests and land have been passed on to ' Fröknarna ' Ingeborg and Margaret as the inheritance of their father, the issuer's father-in-law, with the consent of the issuer's wife Katarina and her sister Birgitta. W
2 CONC itnesses are Lars Boberg, Rörik Birger'S son and Algot Jonsson, who also together with the issuer are sigillanter.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Bengt Eales (winged arrow) Wikipedia - https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengt_Elofsson_(vingad_pil)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Mentioned in 1293, SDHC No. 1590, Dating: February 12, 23==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Content'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Bengt Elofsson announces that 1 farm in "... shoehouse" with country dweller, 1 farm in "alcauid", 1 farmyard in "tubbæthorpe", 1/2 salmon fishing next to "thrasnes", the 2 forests "tansersscogh" and "alxersscogh" and 1 mill in "h
2 CONC eriælungum" accrued to the "seedlings" Ingeborg and Margareta as heritage of their father, the father-in-law of the issuer, with the consent of the issuer's wife Katarina and her sister Birgitta. The witnesses are Lars Boberg, Rör
2 CONC ik Birgersson and Algot Jonsson, who, together with the issuer, are sailors.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/1590.pdf
2 CONT
2 CONT Brorson to Birger Earl. Married (ESFs 12, 23, 26, 27).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Links==
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/svenske/Folkung/Folkung.htm
2 CONT * http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/svenske/Pil/Vingetpil.htm
2 CONT * https://sv.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bengt_Elofsson_(vingad_pil)
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * SDHK-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Algot+jonsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_1590&tab=post#tab 1590]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Utfärdat: 12930223 Innehåll: [https://www.geni.com/people/Bengt-Elofsson-vingad-pil/6000000003490571737 Bengt Elofsson] kungör att 1 gård i ”...shøgh” med landbor, 1 gård i ”alcauid”, 1 landbogård i ”tubbæthorpe”, 1/2 laxfiske i
2 CONC nvid ”thrasnes”, de 2 skogarna ”tansersscogh” och ”alxersscogh” samt 1 kvarn i ”heriælungum” tillfallit ’fröknarna’ Ingeborg och Margareta som arv efter deras far, utfärdarens svärfar, med samtycke av utfärdarens hustru Katarina o
2 CONC ch hennes syster Birgitta. Vittnen är [https://www.geni.com/people/Lars-Bengtsson-Boberg/6000000003645765568 Lars Boberg], [https://www.geni.com/people/R%C3%B6rik-Birgersson-av-Strand/6000000004533169464 Rörik Birgersson] och [htt
2 CONC ps://www.geni.com/people/Algot-Jonsson-Hjorthorn-troliga-barn/6000000009105599804 Algot Jonsson], vilka även tillsammans med utfärdaren ärsigillanter.
