2 CONT * There are several documents in which the children of Asbjørn Sparre and Lucia Matsdatter (the older Oxestierna) leave their farms to their blood relative Halsten Petersson
2 CONT * Jan Raneke "Swedish medieval weapons, p. 484 (On Halsten Petersson's ætt)
