2 CONT Gard I. Toresen Talgø was lagmann. He was born circa 1373 at Talgø, Finnø, Norway. He married Ramborg Knutsdtr Lejon, daughter of Knut Algotsen IX Lejon Folkunge and Marta Ulfsdtr Sweden, circa 1399. He died circa 1427 at Talgø, F
2 CONC innø, Norway. He is mentioned Forsand 275.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ramborg Knutsdtr Lejon was born circa 1360 at Sweden. She married Gard I. Toresen Talgø, son of Tore Benkestokk, circa She died after 1408 at Talgø, Finnø, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT ID: I1067 Name: Gard I Toreson TALGIE Sex: M Birth: ABT 1373 in Garå pa Talgie, Forsand, Norway Death: ABT 1423 in Garå pa Talgie, Forsand, Norway _UID: 231ADBD271A4435E9205D6326ABEFFA40AD3 Change Date: 17 JAN 2005
2 CONT
