2 CONT Sigrid Ivarsdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT Married to Helge Sämundsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigrid Should have been born after 1350 and have probably died before 1450, she was married to Helge Sämundsson, hence we need sources of her husband Thorgils, who has made this connection and based on what?
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynjulf ​​Knutsson. Squire. Inheritance Finnestad in Eidsvolds parish, Norway, after his father, (Knut Brynjulfsson, died before 1456-03-23), but 1460 sold both this farm and two other farms, which the father inherited after his 
2 CONC cousin Sigrid Ivarsdotter , to Mr. Knut Alfsson and Mrs Magnhild Oddsdotter. (RKN).
