2 CONC .geni.com/photo/view/6000000001669618325?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000143083974821
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=holmger&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=5&postid=sdhk_642&tab=post#tab 642]
