2 CONT Ingeborg VALDEMARSDOTTER (FOLKUNGA) PRINCES OF SWEDEN     
2 CONT
2 CONT Ingeborg was born about 1261 in Of, Nykoping, Sodermanland, Sweden.  She died about 1290.
