2 CONT =Näsby in Åkerbo hd, Östergötland=
2 CONT
2 CONT Letter number: 1286 Date of issue: 12850000 b Place of issue: Date comment: Language: Latin DS number: DS 800 SD number: Issuer: Kristina, Birger jarls dotter. Contents: Kristina, Birger Jarl's daughter (and widow of Mr. Sigge Gut
2 CONC tormsson to Ljuna), draws up her will as follows: To the monks in Alvastra, with whom she and her husband chose their burial place, she donates the farm Ljuna (Hogstads parish, Göstrings härad) (1 in its entirety with the exceptio
2 CONC n of an eight and a plot, which she with all additions inextricably links to her farm "wallær"; this is done, however, on condition that all returns of the said farm (Ljuna?) annually on 29/8 She will donate the farm Normlösa (Nor
2 CONC mlösa parish) to Linköping Cathedral, where an altar will be erected on behalf of the bishop, at which each week two masses will be held for the dead, one for the Virgin Mary and a death mass for her deceased husband (2. Finally, 
2 CONC she also donates 1 mark of silver to every monastery in Sweden, with the exception of those on Gotland and in Finland, for communion wine and 1/2 mark silver for every hospital in the country. Sealants are the issuer, King M (agnu
2 CONC s), his brother Duke B (engt) of Finland, Bishop B. (wrong for H.?) In Linköping and the issuer's daughters Margareta and Helena. The witnesses were Abbot Nils in Alvastra and Kristina's confessor brother Knut from Söderköping.
2 CONT
2 CONT Letter number: 928 Date of issue: 12730205 Place of issue: Bjälbo Date comment: Language: Latin DS number: DS 566 SD number: Issuer: Duke Erik, son of the late earl / Duke B. Contents: (Duke) Erik, son of the late earl / Duke B., 
2 CONC announces that in the presence of sensible and credible men he has awarded his sister Kristina two eights in Näsby and a half eighth in "Vengj".
2 CONT
