2 CONC www.geni.com/people/Birger-R%C3%B6riksson-R%C3%B6rik-Birgerssons-%C3%A4tt/6000000005058010111 Birger], [https://www.geni.com/people/Anund-R%C3%B6riksson/6000000004965435385?through=6000000005058010111 Anund] och [https://www.geni.
2 CONC com/people/Folke-R%C3%B6riksson/6000000009106062371?through=6000000005058010111 Fulco] Rörikssöner, Jakob, Hemming, Lars ”Skiärbet”, Thord, Ermer, Michel, Erik, Johan Svärd.
