2 CONC c.) on a sum of 234 marks and 13 herbs, as well as 40 marks for fairs, alms and hay, to which Mr. [https://www.geni.com/people/Ulf-Gudmarsson-Ulv%C3%A5sa / 6000000002601894005 Ulf Gudmarsson] displaced 72 marks and his brother 
