2 CONC  coats of arms prejudiced in the churches of Finland, edited by R. Hausen (1882), Preface and No. 78; B. Hildebrand, Esbjörn Blåpanna and his heirs (Personhist. Journal, 35, 1934, tr. 1935); KH Karlsson, Genealogical notes, 4. Med
