2 CONT * '''Dating: 1384 March 12, Place of issue: Nyköping''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT Finvid Finvidsson trades to '''Bo Jonsson, drots in Sweden''', Nynäs with mill and eel fishing, land in Oppeby, Grinda, Ö. and V. Segersta etc. in Bälinge parish, Stångby in Tystberga parish, Hamra in Bogsta parish, Huseby and Eke
2 CONC by in Råby parish, Ökna in Torsåkers parish, etc. in Rönö district as well as land in Fors parish in Västerrekarne and in Vallby parish in Österrekarne etc. the estates that Bo Jonsson owned in Lidingö in the parish of Danderyd an
2 CONC d ships, etc. as well as in Stockeby and Skärsätra etc. in Solna parish.
2 CONT On the back, signature of Margareta Grip: "Bo bought nýnäs..."
