2 CONT * Daughter of Guttorm Toresson (split shield) & Inga Gregersdotter ( Malstaätten )
2 CONT * Guttorm Toresson (split shield) married to Inga Gregersdotter ( Malstaätten ), they had a daughter Katarina Guttormsdotter, married to Knut Halstensson (half lily) ( Halsten Petersson's family ).
