2 CONT * Gunnar Bendix, "Hammerstaätten". Personal history magazine 1956
2 CONT * Malstaätten, by Ians Gillingstam - https://www.wikitree.com/photo.php/e/eb/Brudsdotter-1.pdf
2 CONT * Malstaätten in Swedish Biographical Lexicon
