2 CONT About Märta Knutsdotter (three roses) and her two sons Håkan and Knut in the marriage with Halsten Petersson (half lily), see H. Gillingstam, Ätterna Oxenstierna ud Vasa und medeltiden (1952), p. 47 f. and p. 739 with note 58; abo
2 CONC ut wife Märta see also ÄSF II, p. 87 f. About Peter, parish priest in By and canon in Västerås and Växjö, see G. Ekström, Västerås stifts herdaminne I:1 (1939), pp. 507 f. with mention of this letter. See also letter 13701028 (DS 
2 CONC no. 8228; SDHK no. 9819 ).
