1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Source: http://www.steig.no/slekt/default.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sysselmann is a Norwegian title of local government. It was used during the Middle Ages as a noble title. It has been revived twice in modern times as a special form of local government, the Governor of Svalbard now holds the titl
2 CONC e and the Governor of Erik the Red's Land held the title from 1932 to 1933.
2 CONT
