2 CONC stina (probably a granddaughter of Inge the Elder.
2 CONT
2 CONT After killing Charles Sverkerson in 1167, Canut, who had just returned home after ten years in exile, started fighting for power against Sverker the Elder's sons Kol and Boleslaw Sverkerson. Only in 1173 could he call himself king
2 CONC  of the whole country.
2 CONT
2 CONT Canute's able jarl from 1174 was Birger Brosa (died in 1202)
2 CONT
