1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Birgitta Magnusdotter (Aspenäs)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birgitta Magnusdotter. Lived 28.8 1398 but buried 7.9 pp. In Vadstena monastery. Inherited Edshult in similar snow in Södra Vedbo hd in Småland. Was first married to Mils Sverkersson ( Stubbe ), who died before 1369. Was 27.3 13
2 CONC 79 married to the knight Mats Gustavsson ( Sparre, Mats Gustavsson's family ), when this mortgaged estate, which belonged to Nils Sverkersson. Mr. Mats appeared in 1374 in connection with the murder of the link-opening bishop Gots
2 CONC kalk and was buried in 1419. He was 11.6 1410 married to Birgitta, daughter of Halsten Petersson (boat) and Katarina Svensdotter (sparrow). Mrs. Birgitta Halstensdotter was married to Nils Jonsson ( Bååt) after Mr. Matt's death.),
2 CONC  who first appears on March 15, 1435, the last time on August 14, 1440, and is mentioned dead (Death Act) 7.1 1441, when his wife lived widowed after him.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Marriages==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married  (1) '''Mils Sverkersson ( Stubbe ),''' who died before 1369. Was 27.3 1379 
2 CONT * Married (2)  '''Knight Matts Gustafsson Sparre ( Sparre, Mats Gustavsson's family ),''' when this mortgaged estate, which belonged to Nils Sverkersson. Mr. Mats appeared in 1374 in connection with the murder of the link-opening 
2 CONC bishop Gotskalk and was buried in 1419. 
2 CONT * Married (3) '''Nils Jonsson ( Bååt) after Mr. Matt's death.),'''who first appears on March 15, 1435, the last time on August 14, 1440, and is mentioned dead (Death Act) 7.1 1441, when his wife lived widowed after him.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''source - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_4
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children with Matts Gustafsson Sparre ==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Matsdotter''' married Bengt Dansson Bååt - 
