2 CONT '''Agneta Eriksdotter, widow of Sten Turesson,''' and Knut Stenson, knight , presents to Archbishop Nicolaus in Uppsala Nicolaus Johannis to receive Vendel's parish church after the deceased Mr. Ingevald. - https://www.geni.com/ph
2 CONC oto/view/6000000001330899240?album_type=photos_of_me&end=&photo_id=6000000140223975954&project_id=&start=&tagged_profiles=
