2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Ingeborg Ivarsdotter, in marriage with Axel Pedersson Thott  to Härlöv, became the mother of the famous brothers Erik, Ivar, Filip and Laurens Axelssöner (Tott), who were closely related to King Karl Knutsson
