2 CONT
2 CONT Adela of Flanders (C. 1064-1115) was a mediavel Danish Queen and Italian Duchess and regent, Queen Consort of King Canute IV of Denmark, and Duchess consort of Duke Roger Borsa of Apulia, and then minor regent of Apulia in 1111-11
2 CONC 15 as mother and guardian of William II of Apulia. Mother of Charles the Good of Flanders.
2 CONT
