1 NOTE He ruled from 1080 to 1086. He was murdered while he was making preparations for an invasion of England.
1 NOTE He ruled from 1080 to 1086. He was murdered while he was making preparations for an invasion of England.
1 NOTE King Canute IV or Knut IV of Denmark, also called Canute the Holy, was a very devout man and relied heavily on spirtual advisers, but, who became unpopular because of his heady tax demans, faced an insurrection, and was killed whi
2 CONC le at church.  He was succeeded by his brother Olaf.
