2 CONT      Erik IX, King of Sweden was the son of Jedvard (?) and Cecily Svensdottir.2 He married Christina Björnsdottir, daughter of Björn, Prince of Denmark.2 He died in 1160.3
2 CONT      Erik IX, King of Sweden also went by the nick-name of Saint Erik Jedvardsson.3 He succeeded as the King Erik of Sweden in 1156.3 Children of Erik IX, King of Sweden and Christina Björnsdottir Margaret Eriksdottir+1 d. 1209 Kn
