2 NOTE It's great that you were able to go so far back in your Norwegian lineage.  I always knew Uncle Earl was cool! The Horntvedt's have it in their blood!  :-D  How on earth were you able to trace so far back?
2 NOTE He was my 24th Great Grandfather.  Norwegian Øystein Haraldsson), born c 1125 apparently in Scotland, died 1157 in Bohuslän, Norway, was king of Norway from 1142 to 1157. 
2 NOTE Its a picture of King Oystein that Gary posted. He's no relative of the Cauzillos.
