1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Karl Dansson Stiernbielke=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Dan Jonsson (Stjärnbielke) and Margareta Eggardsdotter, Bralstorp
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003791053983&photo_id=6000000225648232888&position=0 Children based on Summary Table of Verified Medieval Documents (SHK/ DS)]
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id= 6000000225648232888&&size=large}}  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=  
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Ingegärd Karlsdotter Stjärnbalk;''' SDHK-nr: 7289 (1358): Ingegärd is explicitly named alongside her sister Ingrid and mother Ingeborg in the inheritance split (arvskifte) following her father’s death. SDHK-nr: 5837 & 7289: T
2 CONC hese primary sources prove she was married to Ragvald Nilsson (Fargalt), whom her father Karl Dansson explicitly calls his måg (son-in-law) as early as 1354. Through this marriage, the Fargalt family inherited the prominent Hedens
2 CONC ö estate. SDHK-nr: 11853 (1381): She and her husband remained active in defending their inherited Södermanland properties in a major royal court case decades later.Genealogical
2 CONT * '''Per Karlsson Stiernbielke;''' He is listed in SDHK number: 7289 as an heir of inheritance in the  Swedish Diplomatarium's main index of medieval letters.
2 CONT * '''Ingrid Karlsdotter Stiernbielke;''' She is listed as a daughter in SDHK number: 7289. She was married to  Bengt Larsson bjälke från Västergötland based on SDHK-nr: 11853 (1381): A royal court judgment tracks a long-standing p
2 CONC roperty dispute over lands that Karl Dansson and his wife mortgaged to their son-in-law Bengt Larsson. Because the mortgage took place during Karl Dansson's lifetime (prior to 1358), and because Ingrid's sister Ingegärd was marrie
2 CONC d to Ragvald Nilsson, by a clear process of elimination, Ingrid's husband is proven to be Bengt Larsson.
2 CONT * '''Daan  Karlsson Stiernbielke;''' He is listed in SDHK number: 7289 as an heir of inheritance in the  Swedish Diplomatarium's main index of medieval letters.
2 CONT * '''NN Karlsdotter (Stjärnbjälke);''' Based on SDHK-nr: 7288, Date: 1358, Regarding information about a letter in which Mrs. Ingeborg Magnusdotter makes an exchange with her son-in-law Ragvald Erengislesson Puke. This is proof a 
2 CONC daughter was married to Ragvald Erengislesson Puke in 1358, who was a 14th-century Swedish esquire (väpnare) belonging to the prominent noble Bonde family. He lived during a turbulent political era in medieval Scandinavia, appeari
2 CONC ng in historical records between 1345 and 1381, and passed away before March 1393 (likely between 1381 and 1384). He is notable for adopting the surname Puke from his maternal lineage, creating a distinct branch within the noble B
2 CONC onde clan.  
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stj%C3%A4rnbj%C3%A4lke For the ennobled but not introduced nobleman Stiernbielke, see Stiernbielke]
2 CONT
2 CONT Bishop Anund Jonsson, who was called Bishop Anund, was bishop in Strängnäs diocese 1275–1291 and stood on Magnus Ladulå's side in the war against his brother Valdemar.  His brother Dan Jonsson (Stjärnbjälke), carried in the coat o
2 CONC f arms three stars on an oblique beam and was a knight and councilor, [2] with a seat in Svälinge. [3] Named in 1295 (sigilant, with a very clear coat of arms seal), [4] in 1297 when he renounces the right to two farms his brother
2 CONC  has bequeathed to the church in Strängnäs, [5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Dansson (Stjärnbjälke) and Ingeborg Magnusdotter (daughter of Magnus Gregersson who was the grandson of earl Birger), married in 1324 in Stockholm. Their daughter Ingegärd Karlsdotter married Ragvald Nilsson (Fargalt) in 1354
2 CONC , who had a daughter and two sons.
2 CONT Probable son: In 1361 a letter is mentioned in which Gregers Karlsson (Stiernbielke) pledges goods to Ragvald Nilsson.[6] Johan Dansson, canik in Strängnäs, mentioned as brother of Karl Dansson. [7]
2 CONT In 1385, Mats Gustavsson (sparrow) collected penance from Inge Ingesson (3 stars in column) and Laurens Ingesson (slanted beam coated with three stars) for killing Bård Håkansson (Oxenstierna).[8][9]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1417, on May 9, Inge Ingesson mortgages to Bengt Dansson farms in Ryssby and Böle in Ryssby parish, Norra Möre district.[10]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1599, a Måns Olofsson (Stjärnbjälke) to Ekäng, court eunuch and warlord, is mentioned as the owner of Rösjöholm. Måns was shot during the siege of Kalmar castle on 04/30/1599.[11] Marshal Måns Olofsson (Stiernbielke) was marrie
2 CONC d to Anna Larsdotter Bröms.
2 CONT
2 CONT * The daughter, Margareta Månsdotter (Stjärnbjälke) was married to Göran Armsköld.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Selebo_h%C3%A4rad Selebo. By Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Selebo county's area includes, among other things, Södermanland county's northeasternmost peninsulas and islands in Mälaren. The area consists of the areas around Gripsholmsviken in the southeast and the island kingdom in the nort
2 CONC hwest with i.a. Selaön, Aspö, Ridön and parts of Tosterön. The landscape consists of a small hilly plain landscape divided by forested mountain heights, bays and straits along the fault lines and faults of the gneiss bedrock. The 
2 CONC area is crossed by Enköpingsåsen. In the west, the county borders Åkers county, in the southwest, Daga county and in the southeast, Öknebo county. Farthest to the east is Färentuna district in Stockholm county. In the northeast is
2 CONC  Trögd county and in the north is Åsunda county, both in Uppsala county. Selebo district completely surrounded Mariefred city. The largest urban area is now Stallarholmen, located 16 km east of Strängnäs
2 CONT
2 CONT '''5838b'''. Innehåll: Uppgift om brev i vilket Per Karlsson, Dan Karlsson, Ragvald Nilsson, Gregers Karlsson, Ingrid Karlsdotter och deras moder Ingeborg Magnusdotter skiftade arv efter fadern Carl Dansson 1358. http://www3.ra.se
2 CONC /sdhk/pdf/7289.pdf 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/sdhk/?EndastDigitaliserat=false&Innehall=++Karl+Dansson&TrycktUtgava=true&TrycktRegest=true&Brevtext=true&Extratext=true&Sigill=true&Original=true&MedeltidaAvskrifter=true&MedeltidaRegest=true&Efterme
2 CONC deltidaAvskrifter=true&EftermedeltidaRegest=true&AvanceradSok=False&page=4&postid=sdhk_3297&tab=post#tab SDHK no.: 3297]
2 CONT
2 CONT The Swedish Diplomatarium's main index of medieval letters
2 CONT
2 CONT '''* Dating: 1324 October 5, Place of issue: Stockholm''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Karl Dansson gives his wife Ingeborg''' as a dowry 3 acres of land in Kumla, 20 acres of land in Berga and one öre land in Ingaby. Olof, Archbishop of Uppsala, Knut Jonsson, Erik Valdemarsson, Ulf Gudmarsson, Knut Folkeson, Gre
2 CONC ger Magnusson and the issuer seal.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Original:  Or. perg., RA 0101  images, Post-medieval copies:  Brocman: Misc. 6:28
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Letter text'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Omnibus presentes litteras jnspecturis. Karolu's danson. salutem in domino sempiternam. Noueritis, me dilecte vxori mee Jngiburghi, infrascripta predia, videlicet tres marchas in kumblum. viginti solidos in bierghum. et vnam oram 
2 CONC terre jn jngaby, racione donacionis propter nupcias, dicte wlgariter morghongiffh, dimisisse, perpetuo possenda, tali condicione adiecta, quod proles, si quam ex nobis deus dederit procreari, in dictis predijs succedere debeat,, s
2 CONC uccessione materna, non paterna, si vero alterum nostrum, liberis non extentibus, ab hac vita vocari contigerit, ille nostrum, qui superstes extiterit, predia memorata retineat, absque redempcione seu impeticione quacumque. Jn cui
2 CONC us rei testimonium, sigilla, venerabilis patris domini Olaui Archiepiscopi vpsalensis, ac nobilium virorum, dominorum, kanuti jonsson dapiferi, erici waldemarsson, wlphonis gudmarsson, et kanuti folkason, ac gregorij magnusson, vn
2 CONC a cum sigillo meo proprio, presentibus sunt appensa. Date Stockholmis Anno domini .M.° CCC°. XXIIIº. tercio Nonis octobris.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''SEAL:''' Seals: N. 1, 2, insignificant fragments; N. 3-7 missing; the strips for all, except N. 5, are missing.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Karl+Dansson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=4&postid=sdhk_6002&tab=post SDHK no: 6002]
2 CONT The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating;  1350 June 30, Place of issue: Strangnes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Dansson cedes to the canon of Strängnäs Ingevald Magnusson 4 ertugland of land in Berga in Toresund parish (Selabo district) on the condition that these would accrue to him, if the former before the next Martinidag was not ab
2 CONC le to dedicate to him 4 ertugland in Stensta in Ytterjärna parish (Öknebo district ). Two victuals and 12 fasts are enumerated.
2 CONT
2 CONT I present to all the letters of Inspector Charles Dansson eternal greetings in the Lord. By the present letters I publicly acknowledge that I have released to the honorable and discreet lord Ingiualdo Magnusson, a canon of Strenge
2 CONC n, my estates, namely, four solids of land in the town of Berghom, in the parish of Thorsn, near the estates of the church situated in the same town, duly and reasonably under such conditions: if the same lord Ingiualdo below the 
2 CONC feast of blessed Martin, four solids of land in the town of Stenstum, in the parish of Gerna, in compensation for the same solids according to the laws of the land and I am unable to give and appropriate the approved custom, from 
2 CONC that time excluding all conditions and precautions the same estates in Berghom, as it was promised, together with each and every one of the adjoining estates, in whatever way named, they should cede to themselves and their heirs b
2 CONC y right forever and irrevocably according to their will, as to me and to my heirs, friends, and relatives, every opportunity to interfere with the aforesaid possessions, or any of them, by any right or ability, shall be removed. I
2 CONC n testimony of which these are the witnesses: lord Laurencius Vlpsson, legifer Sudurmannie, Gyøstauus Birgirzson, these are indeed the proud lord Egardus, lord Arnuidus the soldiers, Magnus Ingiualsson, Byrgerus Holmgerzson, Holmg
2 CONC erus Joanson, Olaus Joanson, Benedictus Boson, Nicholaus Folchason, Johannes Olapsson, Elauus Magnusson, Thorstanus Jacobsson, Petrus Andrisson, whose seals I shall mention I ask to be placed with my own present. Given in Stringen
2 CONC s in the year of the Lord m°ccc°l° in commemoration of the blessed Paul the apostle.
2 CONT Extratext
2 CONT On the back: Letter over the estate of Bergha parish Torsn.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/6002.pdf Seal]
2 CONT
2 CONT No. 7, 9-11 n. 1 fragment (stycke af hjelm): igill .; n. 2 (hjelm): s'egardi filii dni lvderi (St. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 541); n. 3 (två sparrar): s' arwidi staphans (Sv. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 684); n. 4 skadadt i kanten, (klufv
2 CONC en sköld): s' magni ingevalss (Sv. Sig fr. Medelt. I, 3, 685); n. 5 (sparre): s' gøztavi birgirs svns (Sv. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 441); n. 6 (snedbjelke): s' birgeri hongers s' (Sv. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 360); n. 8 (klufven sköld
2 CONC , t. h. half flackt örn, t. v. dubbel sågskura): s' olavi . joons s' (St. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 493); n. 12 (snedbjelke med tre stjernor): s' karv . . give .. (St. Sig. fr. Medelt. I, 3, 332).
2 CONT
2 CONT https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Karl+Dansson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=6&postid=sdhk_3297&tab=post SDHK no: 3297]
2 CONT The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1324 October 5, Place of issue: Stockholm'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Dansson gives his wife Ingeborg tomorrow 3 land in Kumla, 20 örtugland in Berga and one öreland in Ingaby. Olof, Archbishop of Uppsala, Knut Jonsson, Erik Valdemarsson, Ulf Gudmarsson, Knut Folkeson, Greger Magnusson and the 
2 CONC issuer seal.
2 CONT
2 CONT A letter of inspection is presented to all. Charles Dansson eternal salvation in the Lord. You have given me, to my dear husband, the underwritten possessions, namely, three marches in the garden. twenty solids in bierghum. and th
2 CONC at one piece of land jn jngaby, by reason of a donation on account of marriages, said vulgarly to be morghongiffh, was released, to be possessed in perpetuity, with such a condition added, that children, if any of us should be pro
2 CONC created by God, should succeed in the said estates, by maternal succession, not paternal, if but the other of us, having no children, happened to be called from this life, the one of us who survived, the estates mentioned let him 
2 CONC retain it, without redemption or demand of any kind. In witness of which, the seals of the venerable father Olaus, Archbishop of Vpsal, and of the noble men, lords, Kanut Jonsson Dapifer, Eric Waldemarsson, Wulfonis Gudmarsson, an
2 CONC d Kanut Folkason, and Gregorij Magnusson, one with my own seal, are attached. Given at Stockholm in the year of the Lord .M.° 300° 244º on the third of the ninth of October.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/3297.pdf Seal]
2 CONT
2 CONT Seal: No. 1, 2, obedydiga fragmenter; No. 3-7 boards; remsorna till alla, utom No. 5, finnas qvar
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Karl+Dansson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=2&postid=sdhk_3800&tab=post SDHK no: 3800]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Swedish Diplomatarium's main catalog of medieval letters'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1331 May 20'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Karl Dansson, with the approval of his wife Ingeborg and her brothers, exchanges 9 öresland in Medellenna and Söderllenna to the knight Nils Abjörnsson for a piece of land in Solberga in Teda parish and 2 herbage lands in Bondakyr
2 CONC klinge. Greger Magnusson, Karl Orostoson, Karl Magnusson, Johannes Magnusson and the issuer seal.
2 CONT
2 CONT To all who see this writing, Karolus Dansson, greetings in the lord's sempiternal Noueritis, I have, by the consent of my beloved spouses of Jingburgh, and at the request of the brothers of the same, made an exchange of land with 
2 CONC the noble soldier lord Nicolaus Abiornason in this manner, that I, Charlesus, assign to the same lord Nicolaus and his heirs the new borders of the land in Medhallen and Sudherlen with each and every one of their adjacencies place
2 CONC d near or at a distance to be permanently possessed by right without any encumbrances or exceptions, receiving from the same lord Nicholas for me and my heirs one march of land in the parish of Solberg and two solids of land in th
2 CONC e town of bondakyrlinge under the conditions of all that are expressly stated above Jn the witness of which is the seal of the noble men lords Gregory Magnusson and Karol Orostson of the soldiers, Karol Magnusson and Johannes Magn
2 CONC usson of arms With my and my spouse's presupposed present, I have attached, Given in the year of the Lord 10030330 pentecost
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/dokument/sdhk/3800.pdf Seal]
2 CONT
2 CONT Seal the gates; 3 remsor qvar
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Ragvald+Erengislesson+Puke&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_7288&tab=post SDHK-nr: 7288]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Date: 1358 without date'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Information about a letter in which Mrs. Ingeborg Magnusdotter makes an exchange with her son-in-law Ragvald Erengislesson Puke.'''
