2 CONT Content
2 CONT
2 CONT Elin Ingemundsdotter in Björnö, Nils in Björnö and his wife Kristina and his brother Jakob exchange to honest man Nils Kettilsson 6 öresland, 1 örtugland in Björnö and 2 örtugland in Östhamra in Frötuna parish, 5 ½ örtugland in Gö
2 CONC ringe (?in Estuna parish), ½ örtugland in Väsby in "Askarna häradh" (now in Frötuna parish), 8 örtugland 3 pennyland in Odenslund and in Vätinge (near Åby), 1 öretland in Igelsta and 2 öretland in Strödja in Söderby parish against
2 CONC  11 öretland 2 örtugland in Ytternäs ( now Nedernäs) and 4 öresland in Övernäs in (Roslags-)Bro parish. 12 fasts are enumerated.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Olof in Bro, Mr. Peter in Estuna, '''Guttorm (Toresson) in Lunda,''' district chief in Bro seal. '''SEAL''' Seal of uncolored wax: n. 1 (under canopy S. Mary with child, to her left kneeling priest): S' Ola[vi] Thome presbyter
2 CONC i ; n
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''': Original:  Or. perg., Sävstaholm collection, RA 0107.21 Post-medieval transcripts:  Transcript fr. approx. 1700 in the Sävstaholm collection, vol. F 34, no. 6b, RA Post-medieval regest/notice:  U 303 a, fol. D 1r, K
2 CONC B.
2 CONT
