2 CONT Eivind Ommundsen Rømer married Brynhild Halvorsdtr Sweden, daughter of Halvard Skjalgs and Ølversdtr Rømer.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born before 1375 at Sweden. He died in 1416 at Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynhild Halvorsdtr Sweden. Her married name was Rømer. She married Eivind Ommundsen Rømer, son of Omund
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnbjørnsen Byre. She was born before 1375 at Sweden. She died at Sweden.
