2 CONT Åsa Haftorsdtr married baron Jon Ivarsen Raud, son of Ivar Fra Skedjuhof and Ragndid (--?--).
2 CONT
2 CONT Baron Jon Ivarsen Raud married Åsa Haftorsdtr, daughter of Haftor Aslaksen. He was sysselmann og ridder. He was
2 CONT
2 CONT born circa 1245. He died circa 1312.
