2 CONT Son of Magnus 'Lawmender' Haakonsson, King of Norway. Buriel ~ Old cathedral which was demolished in 1531. Site is marked by a memorial, in present-day Bergenhus Fortress.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT
2 CONT The book, 'The Oxford History of the British Monarch'
2 CONT
