2 CONT * Carl IX VASA (King) of SWEDEN  
2 CONT * Cecilia (Princess) of SWEDEN   
2 CONT * Elizabeth (GUSTAFSDOTTER) VASA   
2 CONT * Katarina VASA (Princess of SWEDEN) 
2 CONT
