2 CONT >>b)         FLORIS (-before 1061, bur Egmond).  The Chronologia Johannes de Beke names (in order) "Theodricum et Florencium…et Machtildim" as children of Count Floris & his wife[358].  Canon at St Lambert in Liège.  Beke's Egmond
2 CONC sch Necrologium records the death of "Florencius filius Florencii…puer" and his burial "ad caput patris sui postea defuncti"[359].  The reference in this source to "puer" is not considered inconsistent with Floris having been a ca
