2 CONT >>4.         [OGIVE] de Flandre (before 1071-Apr before 1141).  The Flandria Generosa refers to a daughter of Count Robert and his wife Gertrude as "apud Mescinas sanctimonialis et abbatissa venerabilis", but does not name her[371
