2 CONT >>6.         GERTRUDE de Flandre (-[1115/26]).  Galbert of Bruges names "abbatissam Messinis et Gertrudem" as the daughters of Robert I Count of Flanders and his wife Gertrude[376].  Her parentage and both her marriages are deduce
2 CONC d from the Cartulaire de Saint-Bertin which names "Gertrude filia Roberti Frisonis, vidua Henrici Bruselensis" as mother of "Theodericum", who is in turn named "filium Theoderici ducis de Helsath"[377].  The Genealogica Comitum Fl
