1 NOTE http://www.campusprogram.com/reference/en/wikipedia/r/ro/robert_ii_of_f
2 CONT landers.html
1 NOTE Robert II of Flanders
1 NOTE Robert II of Flanders (died 1111) was count of Flanders from 1093 to 
2 CONT 1111. He became known as Robert of Jerusalem after his exploits in the 
2 CONT First Crusade.
1 NOTE He was the eldest son of Robert I of Flanders and Gertrude of Holland.
1 NOTE Robert died from a wound he received while aiding his overlord, King 
2 CONT Louis VI of France, against Theobald of Blois.
1 NOTE He married Clementia of Burgundy, and was succeeded by their son 
2 CONT Baldwin VII of Flanders.
