2 CONT   General Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to "Hervarar Saga", Stenkil was married to Maria Anundsdotter, the daughter of the former king Anund Jacob.
2 CONT
2 CONT Maria married Stenkil Ragnvaldsson of Sweden, son of Ragnvald Ulfsson den Gamle of Sweden and Astrid Njålsdatter. (Stenkil Ragnvaldsson of Sweden was born in 1028 1 and died circa 1066.)
