2 CONT
2 CONT Note on titles: "Bеликий Kнязь" sometimes is translated as "Grand Prince", other times as "Grand Duke", and other times as "King". The first Grand Prince to formally use the title Tsar was Ivan IV (Ivan the Terrible, 1530-1584), t
2 CONC he last of the Rurik dinasty.
