2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p473.htm#i4726
2 CONT
2 CONT Sophie von Braunschweig  F, #4726, d. circa 1394 Last Edited=23 May 2008 Consanguinity Index=1.16%
2 CONT      Sophie von Braunschweig was the daughter of Magnus I Herzog von Braunschweig and Sophie von Brandenburg. She died circa 1394. Child of Sophie von Braunschweig and Dietrich V Graf von Hohnstein-Heringen Agnes von Hohnstein-Her
2 CONC ingen+ b. c 1360, d. 1 Sep 1404 __________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p607.htm#i18234
2 CONT
2 CONT Sophia von Braunschweig1,2 Last Edited	21 Oct 2010 F, #18234, b. 1343, d. 1394 Father	Magnus I 'the Pious', Duke of Brunswick b. c 1304, d. bt 15 Jun 1369 - 15 Aug 1369 Mother	Sophia von Brandenburg b. 1300, d. c 1356
2 CONT      Sophia von Braunschweig was born in 1343. She married Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen, son of Dietrich III, Graf von Hohnstein-Heringen-Tonna and Elizabeth von Waldeck, before 24 August 1366.3,2 Sophia von Braunschweig
2 CONC  died in 1394.2 Family Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen b. c 1306, d. 1379 Citations [S5397] Unknown author, Lineage and Ancestry of HRH Prince Charles by Paget, p. 226; Burke's Guide to the Royal Family, p. 327. [S11600] 40
2 CONC 000 Ancestors of the Counts of Paris, 17-155. [S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XVII, Tafel 92. ____________________________________-_________________
