2 CONT
2 CONT Haraldur harðráði Sigurðsson (Harald Hardråde) (1046-1066): King over Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Ólafur kyrri Haraldsson (Olaf Kyrre) (1066-1093): King over Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Magnús berfættur Ólafsson (Magnus Barefoot) (1073-1103): King over Norway
2 CONT
2 CONT Þóra Magnúsdóttir (1100)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jón Loftsson (1124-1197)
