2 CONT '''Notes for Hjarand White:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Hjarande is a nobleman from western Norway who lived in 1165. Histori. Kker Finn A. Wang argues an article by Hjardane White deleted down from Harald Fairhair and Gyda Eriksen's daughter Aalov (Årbot), who was married to Tore Jarl
