2 CONC  and ÄSF I, p. 47. About the sons Magnus and Johan Trottesson and the gulls Lars Björnsson, Tideke Pinnow and Kort Görtz, see ÄSF I, p. 224. For this part of Ekaätten, see also E. Nordström in PHT 1941-1942, p. 17 ff. About Lars B
2 CONC jörnsson see also SRM p. 57.
2 CONT * Compare letter 1370 9/8 (DS no. 8168) in which Ingegerd with the consent of his son Magnus Trottesson donates a land land in Ekhammar in the parish of Näs as donation for sister Elin to St. Klara monastery.
2 CONT * The transcript of the letter text has obvious formal flaws. Among other things, the pronoun "warä" ("spring") (r. 3) should only refer to Ingegerd. Another example is the subsequent phrase about the husband's consent ("medh mys 
2 CONC husboändä gotwiljä ok kärärelse", not included in the regiment) which is superfluous since he is one of the letter's issuer.
