2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000005069432354?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000174835242875 '''(1) Kerstin Bengtsdotter (Lilja av Värnäs),''']. daughter of Bengt Gjordsson ( Lilja by Värnäs )
2 CONT * Married:  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000005069432354?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000174835242875 '''(2) Märta Arvidsdotter ( spar over star),''']  before 1508, Daughter of Arvid Knutsson, till Torpa (Drake af 
2 CONC Intorp) and Anna Gustafsdotter (äldre Stenbock) 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Kerstin Bengtsdotter''' (Lilja av Värnäs)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Christiern Olofsson Drake,''' Married to Ingeborg.
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Olofsdotter,''' married before 1532 with the gunman Nils Arvidsson ( spar over star ).
2 CONT * '''Jöns Olofsson Drake,'''
2 CONT * '''Erik Olofsson Drake,'''
