1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ingeborg Knutsdotter (Aspenäs)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Knut Bengtsson (Aspenäs) and Sofia Gertsdotter Snakenborg
2 CONT
2 CONT ''' Ingeborg Knutsdotter'''. Var redan 24.12 1428 gift med Magnus Pik, som levde ännu 13.9 1461 men var död 26.8 1462. Denne uppges i släktböcker även ha varit gift med en Bengta Larsdotter. En av Magnus Piks hustrur levde ännu 13
2 CONC .9 1461.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Estrid+pik&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_44978&tab=post SDHK no: 44978]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1444 August 28, Place of issue: Wadstones''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Birgitta Magnusdotter (Porse) , widow of Mr. Erik Stensson (Bielke), describes in an open letter her family on the paternal and maternal side. A daughter of Mrs. Estrid by "Hælghamo" bore the issuer's grandfather Knut Porse, who m
2 CONC arried Svantepolk's granddaughter; they got Magnus Porse who got Birgitta. Another of Estrid's daughters gave birth to Torkel Barun, whose daughter Estrid married Jöns Larsson; they got Erik Jönsson. The issuer's mother Mrs Elin p
2 CONC å Fållnäs had siblings Johan Gregersson and wife Ingeborg. Johan Gregersson's daughter Kristin married Nils Bosson; they had Elin, who is married to Father Ulfsson. Ingeborg in Ärnäs gave birth to Gregers Bengtsson and Knut Bengts
2 CONC son. Gregers Bengtsson's daughter Ingeborg married Matts Ödgislesson. Knut Bengtsson's daughter Kristina married Birger Trolle; '''Knut's daughter Ingeborg married Magnus Pik.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The issuer seals together with the gunsmith Otto Ulfsson and the mayor of Vadstena Eringisle Eskilsson.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Sources:''' Post-medieval transcripts:  Brocman: M 10:12, leaf 70, KB, Printed Klingspor-Schlegel, Engsö (1877), p. xvii Literature and commentary:  About Birgitta Magnusdotter (Porse) see SBL XXIX, p. 412. On Birgitta's moth
2 CONC er's family (Aspenäsätten) see ÄSF I, p. 13 et seq. Regarding the inheritance after Birgitta, see SDHK no. 26246 , SDHK no. 26247 , SDHK no. 26248 with further references. Reference to this letter with Mrs. Birgitta's account can 
2 CONC be found in SDHK no. 27455 . I"Attempt to investigate" Birgitta Magnusdotter's family relationships follows the edition in Klingspor-Schlegel, p. xviii ff.
2 CONT Last
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Magnus+Pik&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=3&postid=sdhk_21095&tab=post SDHK no: 21095]
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1428 December 24, Place of issue: Strangnes''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Magnus Pik and his wife Ingeborg Knutsdotter''' confirm Knut Bengtsson's sale of land in "Tiokkatunom i Bergbo" parish to Strängnäs cathedral.
2 CONT
