2 CONT http://www.tonnquist.se/_text_/6-frls/64-9_gisason.pdf "The Mecklenburg knight Gise van Helpten is known in Sweden from 1369 to 1389. His only attested marriage was to Katarina Bosdotter (Night and Day), contracted in 1372/73. Thi
2 CONC s was the birthplace of Cecilia Gisadotter, who was married to Sven Fjällars-son Pik (mussel) and was still alive in 1463. At the meeting a letter was drawn up, the original of which has been lost; on the National Archives website
2 CONC  there is a copy from the 1400s1. The heir songwriter identified as the uncle of Jöns Abjörnsson's child Kristina Magnusdotter has been named Hans Ulv. However, there was no such in the family, which was investigated by Härenstam2
2 CONC . Apparently, the former vicar of Långaryd refers to Mr. Ulf of the so-called Horjaätten (tin shed). The letter deals with two separate cases..."/...
