1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is a large amount of uncertainty about who the wife of Jon Smør was, and therefore also who's Halvard Jonson Smør's mother. Her name could have been Ulvhild Ragnavaldsdotter/Haakonsdotter, but no proof has be
