2 CONT * '''Axel Månsson,''' Lived without service. 
2 CONT * '''Nils Månsson Roos af Hjelmsäter, till Brosäter,''' [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000190488425897 '''Son of Måns Knutsson Roos, af Hjelmsäter and Christina Gregersdotter'''] Married [https://start.varmlandsro
2 CONC tter.se/varmlandsanor/artiklar/1999_1/ '''Marette Persdotter to Dyngevik,'''] his wife was a Large landowner in Värmland and Dalsland. She inherited salvation property in Steneby parish on Dal after her mother Karin Andersdotter. 
2 CONC After the death of her father Per Larsson's "Little Per", she also inherited the farm estate Bro in Värmland, where she and her husband Nils Månsson Roos are believed to have lived from 1579. After the death of her husband in 1603
2 CONC , Margareta ruled and placed her own domains alone. Only in Steneby under the Dingelvik farm she had 12 saviors. It was not only in Steneby that she owned properties. According to a protocol from 1619, she owned the entire Sund's 
2 CONC farm in the parish of Nössemarks on Dal as well as several salvation homes in Värmland. Margareta Persdotter died childless in Bro around 1629 and as the closest heir, Elin Jacobsdotter her sister of rider champion Lennart Persson
2 CONC  Svenske. According to a protocol from 1619, the entire Sunds farm was owned by Margareta Pedersdotter on Bro. She was probably married to a Pär Nilsson in Bro. He then owned Bro's farm and several other homes in Värmland. Already
2 CONC  in this quote I see an error. Margareta was not married to Pär Nilsson but to Nils Månsson Roos. In addition, Margareta died childless and had no breast wings. Don’t know why he was dropped from Adelsvapen Geneolgy from being a s
2 CONC on of Måns Knutsson (Roos af Hjelmsäter) and Christina Gregorsdotter .
