1 NOTE 867789508. Hertug Ordulf BERNHARDSON av Sachsen was born about 1020.(20706) He was a Hertug in 1059 in Sachsen.(20707) He died on 28 Mar 1072.(20708) He was married to Ulvhild OLAVSDTR av Norge in 1042.
1 NOTE [large-G675.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Stammtafeln calls him Ordulf Duke of Saxony.
2 CONT Brian Tompsett at the University of Hull calles him Otto of Brunswick,Duke of Brunswick.
