1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Bernhard II, Duke of Saxony, b abt 995, d 1057. He md Elica von Schweinfurt abt 1020, daughter of Henry, Count of Schweinfurt, and Gerberge. She was b abt 1004, d aft 1055.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Bernhard II and Elica von Schweinfurt were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Ordulf, Duke of Saxony, b abt 1023.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ida Billung of Saxony b abt 1030. She md Adalbert III, Count of Namur, abt 1060, son of Adalbert II, Count of Namur, and Regilinde of Lorraine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertrude of Saxony b abt 1036. She md:
2 CONT
2 CONT [1] Florent I of Holland, Count of Holland, abt 1052, and
2 CONT
2 CONT [2] Robert le Frison, Count of Flanders, 1063, son of Baldwin V de Lille, Count of Flanders, and Adele Capet.
2 CONT
