2 CONT
2 CONT      Gunhilda Sweynsdottir was the daughter of Sweyn, Jarl.2 She married Svend II Estrithson, King of Denmark, son of Ulf Thorgilson, Earl in England and Astrid Sveynsdottir.1 She died circa 1060. (2)
