2 CONT >>>>(a)       '''[https://www.geni.com/people/Erik-III-King-of-Denmark/6000000001824792339?through=299241483040004362 ERIK] (-Odense, St Knuds Abbey 27 Aug 1146, bur Odense, St Knuds Abbey).  Orkneyinga Saga names “Hakon…the Norse
2 CONC man” as “another grandson” of “Hakon Ivarsson”, adding that he was father of “Eirik the Wise,King of Denmark after Eirik Eymuni”[217].  Morkinskinna names “Eiríkr Lam, the king of the Danes” as the son of “Hákon”, son of “Jarl Hák
2 CONC on”, and his wife “the daughter of King Sveinn Úlfsson”[218].  He succeeded in 1137 as ERIK III "Lam" King of Denmark.  The Chronicon Roskildense records that "Hericum tertium filium sororis…Herici" succeeded on the death of King 
2 CONC Erik II[219].  The Chronicon Roskildense records that "rex…Hericus" became a monk in the tenth year of his reign[220]. -         KINGS of DENMARK.''' 
2 CONT
