2 CONT Iziaslav II of Kiev From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT His first wife was Catherine from unknown family. She died in 1151. Their children were: Mstislav II of Kiev Yaroslav II of Kiev Yaropolk, Prince of Shumsk
