1 NAME Alexios Komnenos, Co-Emperor of the Byzantine Empire
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE FEB 1106
2 PLAC Balabista, Makedonia, Greece
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1142
2 PLAC Antalya, Antalya, Turkey
