2 CONT Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen1,2,3,4 Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 M, #18233, b. circa 1306, d. 1379 Father	Dietrich III, Graf von Hohnstein-Heringen-Tonna b. c 1281, d. bt 29 Sep 1329 - 4 May 1330 Mother	Elizabeth von Waldeck b
2 CONC . c 1281, d. a 24 Oct 1371 Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of George III, King of Great Britain & Ireland
2 CONT
2 CONT      Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen was born circa 1306 at of Hohnstein, Dresden, Saxony, Germany. He married Adelheid (Agnes) von Holstein-Schauenburg-Rendsburg, daughter of Heinrich I, Graf von Holstein-Rendsburg and Hei
2 CONC lwig von Bronckhorst, between 21 September 1326 and 22 February 1333.5,3 Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen married Sophia von Braunschweig, daughter of Magnus I 'the Pious', Duke of Brunswick and Sophia von Brandenburg, befor
2 CONC e 24 August 1366.3,4 Dietrich V, Graf von Honstein-Heringen died in 1379.5,3 ________________________________________________
2 CONT
