2 CONT
2 CONT  Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG     
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of was born about 1300 in Of, Oldenburg, Oldenburg, Germany.  Konrad I Count Of's father is Johann II Count Of OLDENBURG and his mother is Hedwig Countess Of DIEPHOLZ.  His paternal grandfather was Christian III Or 
2 CONC V Count Of OLDENBURG and his paternal grandmother is Hedwig Countess Of OLDENBURG-WILDESHAUSEN; his maternal grandparents are Konrad von DIEPHOLZ and Hedwig Countess of RIETBERG. He had a brother and a sister, named Moritz Count O
2 CONC f and Gisela Countess Of.  He was the oldest of the three children.  He died in 1347.
2 CONT
2 CONT Konrad I Count Of OLDENBURG & Ingeburg Countess Of HOLSTEIN   
2 CONT
2 CONT They were partners, the type of relationship is unspecified.  They had three sons and three daughters, named Konrad II Count Of, Gerhard Count Of, Christian V Count Of, Agnes Countess Of, Ingeburg Countess Of and Anastasia Countes
2 CONC s Of.
2 CONT
