2 CONT
2 CONT Make till N N 
2 CONT
2 CONT Fader till Olof Karlsson Darre 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Karl Darre'' Born: between 1425 and 1432 Death: after 1465 Son of Guttorm Eivindsson and Margarethe Jonsdotter Darre Husband of N N Father of Olof Karlsson Darre
2 CONT
