1 NAME Alv /Erlingsson/
2 GIVN Alv
2 SURN Erlingsson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 PLAC Storgården Tornberg
2 ADDR
3 CITY Norderhov
3 STAE Buskerud
3 CTRY Norge
1 BURI
2 DATE 1290
2 ADDR
