1 NAME Gustav /Johansson (Tre rosor)/
2 GIVN Gustav
2 SURN Johansson (Tre rosor)
2 NICK Gustaf
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 8 MAY 1531
2 ADDR
3 CITY Nyköping Castle
3 STAE Södermanland
3 CTRY Sweden
