2 CONT * 1.'''Ramborg Nilsdotter (Vasa)''' (mentioned 1376 and 1439) Married before 9 October 1376 Tord Bonde Roriksson, son of Rorik Tordsson Bonde and Marta (Margareta) Gisladotter (Sparre av Aspaa) (died 21 March 1417, buried Vadstena
