2 CONT
2 CONT * 3.2.5.2. '''Ebba Eriksdotter (Vasa)''' (died 22 November 1549) Married 18 January 1512 Soderkoping Erik Abrahamsson Leijonhufvud pa Loholmen, Governor of Westergotland, son of Abraham Kristiernsson (Leijonhufvud) pa Ekeberg and 
