2 CONT * 3.3.2. '''Erik Johansson (Vasa)''' (born 1470 - died 8 November 1520 Stockholm (beheaded)) Married Cecilia Mansdotter (Ekaatten), daughter of Magnus Carlsson pa Eka and Sigrid Eskilsdotter (Baner) pa Lindholmen (died ca.1523)
2 CONT
