2 CONC 8 and Bona Sforza (born 1 November 1526 - died 16 November 1583 Stockholm) Married (2) 21 February 1585 Wester†s Gunnilla Bielke, daughter of Johan Axelsson Bielke and Margareta Axelsdotter Posse (born 25 June 1568 Liljestad - die
