0 @N6000000005076735971@ NOTE Margaret of Scotland, Princess of Scotland was born on 28 February 1261 at Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, England.2 She was the daughter of Alexander III 'the Glorius', King of Scotland and Margaret of England, Princess of En
1 CONC gland. She married Eirik II Magnusson, King of Norway, son of Magnus VI Haakonsson, King of Norway and Ingeborg Eriksdottir, Princess of Denmark, circa 31 August 1281 at Bergen, Norway.2 She died on 9 April 1283 at age 22 at Tönsb
1 CONC erg, Norway, in childbirth.2 She was buried at Christ Kirk, Bergen, Norway.2
1 CONT Child of Margaret of Scotland, Princess of Scotland and Eirik II Magnusson, King of Norway
1 CONT Margaret 'Maid of Norway' Eriksdottir, Queen of Scotland b. b 9 Apr 1283, d. c 26 Sep 1290
