1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Robert Curthose (c. 1054 – 1134), Duke of Normandy, married Sybil of Conversano, daughter of Geoffrey of Conversano
1 CONT    2. Adeliza (or Alice) (c. 1055 – ?), reportedly betrothed to Harold II of England (Her existence is in some doubt.)
1 CONT    3. Cecilia (or Cecily) (c. 1056 – 1126), Abbess of Holy Trinity, Caen
