0 @N6000000000337165932@ NOTE (Research):Dirk V, Count of Holland 1061-1091, (1053-1091)  Born circa 1053 Died 17 June 1091  Married before 26 July 1083  Othelhildis   In 1061, and still a minor, he became Count of Holland and Bishop Willem of Utrecht, profiti
1 CONC ng from this minority by annexing the county of Holland to his already extensive bishopric of Utrecht. It would take until 1076 before Dirk V, assisted by his step-father, Robrecht the Fries, Count of Flanders, recovered his terri
1 CONC tory and imprisoned the Bishop of Utrecht in the process.    Source: Leo van de Pas
